<title>RUSSIA: Russia to sell 10 trln rbls Tbills Apr 9. [corrected 11:02 gmt]</title>
<headline>Russia to sell 10 trln rbls Tbills Apr 9. [corrected 11:02 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(corrects headline to show sale is of T-bills only).</p>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will auction six trillion roubles in 364-day GKO discount treasury bills (series 23004) and an additional four trillion rouble tranche of 119-day T-bills (series 22073), both on April 9, the Central Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Full details of the T-bill issues:</p>
<p>    Series number		  23004</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   6.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		   1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		     April 9, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			    364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  April 8, 1998</p>
<p>    Series number		  22073</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		   1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		     April 9, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			    119 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  August 6, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
